%% Session-arena state machine - standalone copy of the diagram in
%% doc/memory_model.md §3.5. Render with:
%%   mmdc -i doc/session_arena_lifecycle.mmd -o /tmp/session_arena_lifecycle.png
stateDiagram-v2
    state "UNARMED - everything goes to the FreeRTOS heap" as Unarmed
    state "ARMED - allocations bump POOL / TRANSPORT from offset 0" as Armed

    [*] --> Unarmed : reset - ARMED is a .bss bool, false at every boot
    Unarmed --> Armed : first scan - target_list_free then swindle_session_open
    Armed --> Armed : next scan - unwind the list, wipe, re-arm
    Armed --> Armed : D detach - target list kept, nothing disarmed
    Armed --> [*] : region full or heap malloc null - logged, then panic deadEnd(55)
    Unarmed --> Unarmed : boot allocations stay in the heap, never wiped
    Armed --> [*] : probe reset / reboot
